{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/2abc9fd3de44b12ea0915e660b2ea4a5.poster.avif?t=1774310307\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/2abc9fd3de44b12ea0915e660b2ea4a5.webm?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/2abc9fd3de44b12ea0915e660b2ea4a5.mp4?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the Great Downpour continued to flood the world, desperate hands built the Typhon Obelisk to swallow the endless oceans... before it was abruptly abandoned.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <u>first-ever first-person Sudoku horror</u> as you descend the reverberating infrastructure of the obelisk layer by layer. Solve Sudoku, run, and hide as you unravel what kind of horrors lie within. Will your daring descent as Nick Gideon successfully rejuvenate the obelisk back to life and save the world from drowning?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUDOKU... BUT HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve randomly generated Sudoku puzzles of varying difficulties with their accompanying dark levels and environments. No level plays out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something's moving between the pipes of the Typhon Obelisk... Better lay low and avoid making mistakes; you do <i>not</i> want to draw its attention.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISK VS. REWARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/1bcdfc8bd043be568706deea814085c1.poster.avif?t=1774310307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/1bcdfc8bd043be568706deea814085c1.webm?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/1bcdfc8bd043be568706deea814085c1.mp4?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize scattered devices and machinery around you to better your chances of survival. Are you willing to sacrifice a save station in order to solve a random cell in your challenging Sudoku puzzle?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for something extreme? Dare yourself to an enduring one-life run in the <i>Endless</i> game mode, or perhaps a <i>Daily Run</i> would be more your style? If you ever feel crafty, design your own complete VIVARIUM experience in the <i>Custom</i> game mode. <strong><i>Go nuts.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SIPHONING ACTIVE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"EQUILIBRIUM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"SEVENTY MILLION GALLONS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"YIELD STRENGTH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"DIVING DEEP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"PIPE FEVER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"CONDENSATION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"WELCOME HOME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"YOU GOT NERVE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"},{"name":"HAHAHAHA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3810390/ce3094c7abde9852700f8ab60b0dfdf6eb751ecd.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810390?t=1774310307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/6a48ec2708ddef74866eead56012e6e05f799ea6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774310307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/9d26cc256ddf30add9f0eb842c1c701b605e0ec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774310307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/9d26cc256ddf30add9f0eb842c1c701b605e0ec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774310307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game is set in a realistic, dark atmosphere. Both the player and the entities within are subject to violence, burning, or death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/2abc9fd3de44b12ea0915e660b2ea4a5.poster.avif?t=1774310307\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/2abc9fd3de44b12ea0915e660b2ea4a5.webm?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/2abc9fd3de44b12ea0915e660b2ea4a5.mp4?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the Great Downpour continued to flood the world, desperate hands built the Typhon Obelisk to swallow the endless oceans... before it was abruptly abandoned.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <u>first-ever first-person Sudoku horror</u> as you descend the reverberating infrastructure of the obelisk layer by layer. Solve Sudoku, run, and hide as you unravel what kind of horrors lie within. Will your daring descent as Nick Gideon successfully rejuvenate the obelisk back to life and save the world from drowning?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUDOKU... BUT HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve randomly generated Sudoku puzzles of varying difficulties with their accompanying dark levels and environments. No level plays out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something's moving between the pipes of the Typhon Obelisk... Better lay low and avoid making mistakes; you do <i>not</i> want to draw its attention.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISK VS. REWARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/1bcdfc8bd043be568706deea814085c1.poster.avif?t=1774310307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/1bcdfc8bd043be568706deea814085c1.webm?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/extras/1bcdfc8bd043be568706deea814085c1.mp4?t=1774310307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize scattered devices and machinery around you to better your chances of survival. Are you willing to sacrifice a save station in order to solve a random cell in your challenging Sudoku puzzle?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for something extreme? Dare yourself to an enduring one-life run in the <i>Endless</i> game mode, or perhaps a <i>Daily Run</i> would be more your style? If you ever feel crafty, design your own complete VIVARIUM experience in the <i>Custom</i> game mode. <strong><i>Go nuts.</i></strong></p>","developers":["Amr Hassan"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810390/111edac194d8ae17947f4f58d2f2a807bf7c01c4/header.jpg?t=1774310307","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810390/479392051/8728d6159edbf94401a438df541af81526983ed9/1773995502/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773996326","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810390/479392051/8728d6159edbf94401a438df541af81526983ed9/1773995502/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773996326","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810390/479392051/8728d6159edbf94401a438df541af81526983ed9/1773995502/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773996326","id":257218599,"name":"VIVARIUMS Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218599/07e8473ff566e19a5222f997dd60fecd5fcf8141/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773996326"}],"name":"VIVARIUMS","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default",